### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8082

### 1. Register a Patient (Full Demographics)
# @name registerPatient
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Robert",
  "lastName": "Langdon",
  "dateOfBirth": "1970-06-22",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "phone": "9805626007",
  "email": "robert.langdon@harvard.edu",
  "addressLine1": "Harvard Yard 101",
  "city": "Cambridge",
  "postalCode": "02138",
  "emergencyContactName": "Vittoria Vetra",
  "emergencyContactPhone": "+390669871234",
  "emergencyContactRelation": "Colleague"
}

### 2. Register Another Patient (Minimal Demographics)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Sarah",
  "lastName": "Connor",
  "dateOfBirth": "1985-02-28",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "phone": "+14155552671",
  "email": "sarah.connor@example.com"
}

### 3. Get Patient by ID
# Replace {{patientId}} with the UUID returned from registration
@patientId = 3b8ed703-8ec6-432d-9f9a-0922a859b096
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients/{{patientId}}

### 4. Get Patient by Medical Record Number (MRN)
# Replace {{mrn}} with the MRN returned from registration
@mrn = MRN-20260909-639511
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients/mrn/{{mrn}}

### 5. Get All Patients (Paginated & Sorted)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients?page=0&size=10

### 6. Test Duplicate Phone Conflict (Expects HTTP 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Duplicate",
  "lastName": "Patient",
  "dateOfBirth": "1990-01-01",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "phone": "+16175550199",
  "email": "duplicate@example.com"
}

### 7. Test Validation Error (Expects HTTP 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "",
  "lastName": "Test",
  "dateOfBirth": "2099-01-01",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "phone": "",
  "email": "invalid-email"
}

### 8. Test Patient Not Found (Expects HTTP 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/patients/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
